; atleast_k_range_beats_sample_mode: k is range-checked before the model
; register is discriminated.
;
; exec_at_least resolves the indices vec and rejects k <= 0 before it ever
; looks at what r0 holds, so a sample register with k = 0 raises
; IndexOutOfBounds. xqvm_py checked the mode first and raised its mode
; fault.
;
; What this pins is which rule fires, not what the mode fault is called.
; The Rust VM never reaches its register check at all here, so the two
; disagreed about ordering rather than about an identity -- and the
; identity is settled as TypeMismatch in any case (QUI-1160).

PUSH 4
BSMX r0          ; a sample, not a model

VEC r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2

PUSH 0           ; k = 0, outside [1, n]
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ATLEAST r0 r2
HALT
